Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 05:30:09 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: manage local names and aliases from tele settings

Two screens under a 'your data' header list every stored local name and
alias as peer name plus current value. Tapping a row opens the existing
edit dialog, which already offers Delete; entries are read again on
resume so the list follows the change.

Confidence: high
Scope-risk: narrow
